<ContentLayout title="The Aurora Ecosystem" description="Aurora is a computing ecosystem centered on Aurora OS, with Lumen as its browser workstream." heading="One ecosystem, centered on Aurora OS." lead="Aurora brings its operating system, browser and supporting software under one direction. Aurora OS is the foundation; Lumen is being developed as part of the same ecosystem.">
  <section class="section shell">
    <article class="ecosystem-feature">
      <div><h2>Aurora OS</h2><p class="content-copy">The core of the ecosystem. A from-scratch operating-system project written in Rust, designed around a capability-based microkernel direction. It is in development and has no public release yet.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/ecosystem/os/">Explore Aurora OS ↗</a></div>
    </article>
    <article class="ecosystem-feature ecosystem-feature-secondary">
      <div><h2>Lumen Browser</h2><p class="content-copy">The web browser workstream within Aurora. It is a companion application in the ecosystem, not a separate platform competing with Aurora OS.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/ecosystem/browser/">Explore Lumen ↗</a></div>
    </article>
    <div class="ecosystem-note"><h2>One project. Connected components.</h2><p class="content-copy">Aurora Website is the public home for the ecosystem. It is not another product. More components may be introduced as they become real, usable parts of Aurora.</p></div>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>